          "text": "0.90"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "0.20"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "0.70"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "0.60"
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": "0.50"
        }
      ],
      "correct_answer": "C",
      "explanation": "Bağımsız olaylarda P(A ∩ B) = P(A) * P(B) = 0.4 * 0.5 = 0.20. P(A ∪ B) = P(A) + P(B) - P(A ∩ B) = 0.4 + 0.5 - 0.2 = 0.70.",
